Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}How do you test
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.76,0:00:02.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a warship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}In Sweden they put
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}thirty{\r} men on deck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and told them to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}run from side to side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Three runs in, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:08.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}ship was rolling so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:10.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}badly they stopped the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:12.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}test. And the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}They let it sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}Stockholm, sixteen twenty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A brand new warship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}called Vasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:23.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Two gun decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:25.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Carved lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:27.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Apparently, if a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}looks expensive enough, physics
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}gets embarrassed and looks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A gust of wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}caught the sails.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The ship heeled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:37.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Water poured through the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:38.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}open gunports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Total distance from glorious
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}departure to the bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:45.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}About thirteen hundred metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}An inquiry followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Nobody was punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Thirty guys tested the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}ship. Turns out the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}ship was testing the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}whole damn system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Does your boss also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}think stopping a test
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}means you've passed it?
